{
  "title": "Checkout service",
  "notes": "# Checkout service\n\nHow a basket becomes money in the bank, and who touches it on the way.\n\nStart at @[Web app] and follow the arrows right. **A box with a corner badge holds a drawing of its own.** Click it twice to look inside, and click the breadcrumb to come back.\n\n| Colour | What it is |\n|---|---|\n| Blue | Something a customer touches |\n| Green | A service we own |\n| Amber | State we keep |\n| Violet | Somebody else's API |\n",
  "shapes": [
    {
      "id": "edge",
      "type": "container",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 780,
      "h": 280,
      "text": "Edge",
      "notes": "Everything in here is deployed to the CDN edge, close to the customer.",
      "style": {
        "stroke": "#94a3b8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "web",
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 70,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 100,
      "text": "Web app",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#eff6ff",
        "stroke": "#2563eb"
      },
      "notes": "# Web app\n\nNext.js, served from the edge.\n\n- SSR for the catalogue\n- Client-side cart\n\nInside: the two screens that matter.",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "web-cart",
          "type": "rect",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 80,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 100,
          "text": "Cart",
          "style": {
            "fill": "#eff6ff",
            "stroke": "#2563eb"
          },
          "notes": "Held in local storage until sign-in, then merged server-side."
        },
        {
          "id": "web-cart-icon",
          "type": "icon",
          "x": 130,
          "y": 210,
          "w": 56,
          "h": 56,
          "text": "basket",
          "style": {
            "textColor": "#2563eb"
          },
          "href": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M5.588 21.413Q5 20.825 5 20t.588-1.412T7 18t1.413.588T9 20t-.587 1.413T7 22t-1.412-.587m10 0Q15 20.825 15 20t.588-1.412T17 18t1.413.588T19 20t-.587 1.413T17 22t-1.412-.587M5.2 4h14.75q.575 0 .875.513t.025 1.037l-3.55 6.4q-.275.5-.737.775T15.55 13H8.1L7 15h12v2H7q-1.125 0-1.7-.987t-.05-1.963L6.6 11.6L3 4H1V2h3.25z\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": "web-pay",
          "type": "rect",
          "x": 400,
          "y": 80,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 100,
          "text": "Pay sheet",
          "style": {
            "fill": "#eff6ff",
            "stroke": "#2563eb"
          },
          "notes": "Hosted fields from the PSP: card numbers never reach our origin."
        },
        {
          "id": "web-pay-icon",
          "type": "icon",
          "x": 472,
          "y": 210,
          "w": 56,
          "h": 56,
          "text": "card",
          "style": {
            "textColor": "#2563eb"
          },
          "href": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 20q-.825 0-1.412-.587T2 18V6q0-.825.588-1.412T4 4h16q.825 0 1.413.588T22 6v12q0 .825-.587 1.413T20 20zm0-8h16V8H4z\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": "web-flow",
          "type": "arrow",
          "from": "web-cart",
          "to": "web-pay",
          "fromSide": "right",
          "toSide": "left",
          "text": "checkout",
          "notes": "One step, and the whole funnel hangs off it: **31% drop out here**.\n\nThe cart is posted, the sheet is mounted, nothing is charged yet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 70,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 100,
      "text": "Checkout API",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#ecfdf5",
        "stroke": "#059669"
      },
      "notes": "# Checkout API\n\nOwns the order state machine, and it is the only writer to @[Postgres].",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "api-http",
          "type": "rect",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 60,
          "w": 190,
          "h": 90,
          "text": "HTTP layer",
          "style": {
            "fill": "#ecfdf5",
            "stroke": "#059669"
          },
          "notes": "Validation and auth. No business rules live here."
        },
        {
          "id": "api-orders",
          "type": "rect",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 240,
          "w": 190,
          "h": 90,
          "text": "Order state",
          "style": {
            "fill": "#ecfdf5",
            "stroke": "#059669"
          },
          "notes": "`draft → placed → paid → shipped`, and nothing skips a step."
        },
        {
          "id": "api-a1",
          "type": "arrow",
          "from": "api-http",
          "to": "api-orders",
          "fromSide": "bottom",
          "toSide": "top",
          "text": "command",
          "notes": "Every transition is a command with an idempotency key, so a retry is free."
        },
        {
          "id": "api-db-link",
          "link": "db",
          "x": 420,
          "y": 240,
          "w": 190,
          "h": 90
        },
        {
          "id": "api-a2",
          "type": "arrow",
          "from": "api-orders",
          "to": "api-db-link",
          "text": "writes",
          "notes": "One transaction per transition. The row *is* the state; there is no cache to go stale."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "db",
      "type": "ellipse",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 70,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 100,
      "text": "Postgres",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#fef3c7",
        "stroke": "#d97706"
      },
      "notes": "Orders, payments and the outbox, in one database. Backed up every hour."
    },
    {
      "id": "psp",
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 330,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 100,
      "text": "Payments\nprovider",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#f5f3ff",
        "stroke": "#7c3aed"
      },
      "notes": "Third party. Cards go straight from the browser to them; we only ever see a token."
    },
    {
      "id": "decide",
      "type": "diamond",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 330,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "Fraud?\ncheck",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#fef2f2",
        "stroke": "#dc2626"
      },
      "notes": "Scored in-line, under 80 ms. Anything over the threshold is held for review."
    },
    {
      "id": "a-web-api",
      "type": "arrow",
      "from": "web",
      "to": "api",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toSide": "left",
      "text": "REST",
      "notes": "`POST /orders`, one call, and the response is the whole order."
    },
    {
      "id": "a-api-db",
      "type": "arrow",
      "from": "api",
      "to": "db",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toSide": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "a-api-decide",
      "type": "arrow",
      "from": "api",
      "to": "decide",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toSide": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "a-decide-psp",
      "type": "arrow",
      "from": "decide",
      "to": "psp",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toSide": "left",
      "text": "charge",
      "notes": "Only once the score comes back clean. A held order never reaches the provider."
    },
    {
      "id": "fast-icon",
      "type": "icon",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 340,
      "w": 60,
      "h": 60,
      "text": "p99 180 ms",
      "style": {
        "textColor": "#059669"
      },
      "href": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m8 22l1-7H4l9-13h2l-1 8h6L10 22z\"/></svg>"
    },
